iple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鵝頸瓶經過加熱之後，瓶內空氣就不再造成污染","n":21,"ssz":"...............1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鵝頸瓶的主要作用，就是把外界空氣完全隔絕掉","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文先寫「最普遍的解釋是自然發生說」，接著又寫「但法國的科學家巴斯德卻有一個新的說法」，這樣安排最能突顯什麼？","n":55,"ssz":"....................................11................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"巴斯德的觀點，是把原有觀念說得更加完整","n":19,"ssz":"..............1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"巴斯德的觀點，是從舊說法中找到較合理部分","n":20,"ssz":"...................1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"巴斯德的觀點，是把注意重點轉到實驗工具上","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"巴斯德的觀點，是對既有的解釋提出挑戰","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE，在文字層但非 ☑ 字元）10 個，PDF p3~p5 全部可見；\n步驟❶第 1、2 小題的答案是橘色手寫，也在文字層。","n":85,"ssz":"....................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE，在文字層但非 ☑ 字元）10 個，PDF p3~p5 全部可見；","n":58,"ssz":".........................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟❶第 1、2 小題的答案是橘色手寫，也在文字層。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟❷第 2~4 題的選項在原稿是「操作➜結果」，那個 ➜ 是 w:sym Wingdings F0E0，\n**不在 w:t 文字流**。選項照原稿保留箭號，但在箭號前後斷行（HTML 會把換行收成空格，\n畫面上仍是一行），這樣逐字門切段後兩側都比得到，箭號本身不會被誤判成抄錯。","n":140,"ssz":".........................